<section class="card call-to-action">
  <h3>Propose edits for this essay</h3>
  <p>
    Choose how substantial your contribution will be. Minor suggestions cover phrasing,
    typos, and small clarifications. Major suggestions reshape sections or add new
    arguments and will be reviewed as coauthor-level contributions.
  </p>
  <div class="cta-row" style="flex-wrap:wrap; gap:0.75rem;">
    <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="{{ minorIssueUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
      Suggest minor change
    </a>
    <a class="btn btn-primary" href="{{ majorIssueUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
      Suggest major change
    </a>
  </div>
  <p class="muted" style="margin-bottom:0;">
    Each link opens a prefilled GitHub issue scoped to <code>{{ ctaRelativePath }}</code>.
  </p>
</section>
